        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function takes in a const reference to an <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_vector2" kindref="compound">AGE::Vector2</ref> and encodes it into a Node object by pushing the x and y coordinates of the Vector2 onto the Node. The encoded Node is then returned.</para>
