        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function attempts to decode the given Node object into an <ref refid="struct_a_g_e_1_1_vector2" kindref="compound">AGE::Vector2</ref>. It checks if the node is a sequence and has exactly two elements, then assigns the first element of the node as x value of the vector and the second one as y value. If the conditions are not met, it returns false.</para>
